    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.4968872070312,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "may be relatively high (e.g. for infrastructure, human resources, training, equipment, community",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.3727416992188,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "engagement), but that costs are likely to decrease over time – assuming that people with TB are",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.4421997070312,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "effectively managed and that TPT is provided at the peripheral level, leading to a reduction in TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.4268188476562,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "incidence. Decentralized and family-centred, integrated services may result in important savings for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.4411010742188,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "affected families. Equity was considered an important cross-cutting issue that also has an impact on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.1018676757812,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "cost. The GDG highlighted that TPT implementation can be very challenging with high levels of loss to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.97562313079834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        527.5415649414062,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "follow-up in programmes implemented at higher levels of the health system, considering that children",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.970911979675293,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.7907257080078,
        527.3925170898438,
        174.2337188720703
      ],
      "text": "who are eligible for TPT are not sick. The panel agreed that the decentralization and integration of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        172.99073791503906,
        527.4277954101562,
        187.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "services can potentially increase equity and enhance the success of the programme and judged that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        186.1907501220703,
        527.3143310546875,
        200.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "cost-effectiveness probably favours decentralized and family-centred, integrated approaches to both",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98739242553711,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.3907012939453,
        245.9740753173828,
        213.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "case-finding and the provision of TPT.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09461975097656,
        527.3817138671875,
        235.53761291503906
      ],
      "text": "While the GDG stressed the importance of taking into consideration the potential impact of stigma",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.2946319580078,
        527.4157104492188,
        248.7376251220703
      ],
      "text": "when decentralizing TB services for children and adolescents to lower levels, the panel judged that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.49464416503906,
        527.4089965820312,
        261.9376525878906
      ],
      "text": "decentralized approaches are probably acceptable to key stakeholders. Overall, decentralized and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.694580078125,
        527.4188842773438,
        275.1376037597656
      ],
      "text": "family-centred, integrated approaches were judged to be feasible to implement, although feasibility",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.89459228515625,
        527.4444580078125,
        288.3376159667969
      ],
      "text": "may vary depending on factors such as infrastructure, availability of funding and the structure of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        287.0947265625,
        527.3937377929688,
        301.5377502441406
      ],
      "text": "national TB programme. However, adequate investment is critical to enable the acceptability, equity",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        300.294677734375,
        268.5449523925781,
        314.7377014160156
      ],
      "text": "and feasibility of decentralized approaches.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        328.1119079589844,
        209.15652465820312,
        343.9638977050781
      ],
      "text": "Subgroup considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.47807312011719,
        351.06182861328125,
        527.439697265625,
        365.6148376464844
      ],
      "text": "Adolescents  have a disease presentation that is similar to that of adults and therefore may need",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        364.3719177246094,
        527.11572265625,
        378.81494140625
      ],
      "text": "different interventions than those for young children. Additional subgroup considerations for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        377.5718078613281,
        524.5606079101562,
        392.01483154296875
      ],
      "text": "adolescents are included in the WHO operational handbook, taking into account their specific health-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.978679656982422,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        390.7718200683594,
        365.8334045410156,
        405.21484375
      ],
      "text": "seeking behaviour and the need for adolescent-friendly services.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.47807312011719,
        412.3658142089844,
        527.5759887695312,
        426.9188232421875
      ],
      "text": "TB contacts:  Provision of TPT has for many years focused mainly on children under five years of age.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 10.991796493530273,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        424.3998107910156,
        527.4215698242188,
        440.11883544921875
      ],
      "text": "(160) In 2018, target groups for the provision of TPT were expanded to include contacts of all ages  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.59979248046875,
        527.4178466796875,
        453.3188171386719
      ],
      "text": "(161) Available data from the global TB database   show that coverage of TPT in household contacts",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        452.0758056640625,
        313.6229248046875,
        466.5188293457031
      ],
      "text": "is poor – especially in contacts over five years of age.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        473.7796936035156,
        527.3990478515625,
        488.22271728515625
      ],
      "text": "In children with common illnesses with overlapping signs and symptoms of TB, approaches that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        486.9797058105469,
        452.835693359375,
        501.4227294921875
      ],
      "text": "integrate TB services in their care can improve case detection and provision of TPT.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        508.68359375,
        190.48892211914062,
        523.1265869140625
      ],
      "text": "These subgroups include:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        530.3875732421875,
        78.23609924316406,
        544.83056640625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        530.3875732421875,
        168.03140258789062,
        544.83056640625
      ],
      "text": "children with SAM;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        543.587646484375,
        78.23609924316406,
        558.0306396484375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        543.587646484375,
        234.1072998046875,
        558.0306396484375
      ],
      "text": "children with severe pneumonia;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        556.78759765625,
        78.23609924316406,
        571.2305908203125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        556.78759765625,
        210.35943603515625,
        571.2305908203125
      ],
      "text": "children living with HIV; and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        569.9876098632812,
        78.23609924316406,
        584.4306030273438
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        569.9876098632812,
        248.1532440185547,
        584.4306030273438
      ],
      "text": "children with other chronic diseases.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        597.8048095703125,
        245.23455810546875,
        613.6568603515625
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.47807312011719,
        620.7546997070312,
        527.3743286132812,
        635.3076782226562
      ],
      "text": "Health system requirements : Training of health-care workers at peripheral levels of the health system",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 10.95350170135498,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        634.0648193359375,
        527.2880249023438,
        648.5078125
      ],
      "text": "is a critical requirement for ensuring that decentralized approaches are implemented adequately.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        647.2647705078125,
        527.5763549804688,
        661.707763671875
      ],
      "text": "Similarly, resources are needed at the peripheral level – especially initially to establish services. It",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        660.46484375,
        527.2021484375,
        674.9078369140625
      ],
      "text": "is expected that, as services are established and effectively implemented, the long-term impact",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        673.6646728515625,
        527.4366455078125,
        688.107666015625
      ],
      "text": "will result in a decrease in TB incidence with an associated reduction in resource requirements. A",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        686.8646850585938,
        527.4541625976562,
        701.3076782226562
      ],
      "text": "phased approach may be applied if this is most appropriate in the country or area, depending on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        700.0648193359375,
        527.4466552734375,
        714.5078125
      ],
      "text": "the local burden of TB, the availability of domestic or donor funding and the amount of technical",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        713.2648315429688,
        200.74972534179688,
        727.7078247070312
      ],
      "text": "and programmatic support.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        734.9686889648438,
        527.4608154296875,
        749.4116821289062
      ],
      "text": "Factors to consider in decentralizing child and adolescent TB services include: the existing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        748.168701171875,
        527.57177734375,
        762.6116943359375
      ],
      "text": "infrastructure (such as baseline health infrastructure, needs for expansion or upgrading); an",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        39.172698974609375,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "196 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
